            <description><![CDATA[<h2>DataFluss 1.3.1</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>New icon:</strong> two tables with arrows between them, for what DataFluss does: your data on this computer and on the server, kept in step in both directions.</li>
  <li>The web app has the new icon too, in the browser tab and when installed.</li>
  <li>Nothing else changes, and the database stays the same: computers keep syncing with servers on 1.3.0.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
